r.avif?t=1732114955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/7794fb4282be3204689683f38cc8e8a0.webm?t=1732114955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/7794fb4282be3204689683f38cc8e8a0.mp4?t=1732114955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/7c5f3d31862338985fbc714995896f09.avif?t=1732114955\" /></div> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Campy horror fun<br></li><li>A spooky side-scrolling adventure with atmospheric 3D art packed with charm <br></li><li>A killer soundtrack by Reversed Flow, inspired by 80's horror classics<br></li><li>Complete side quests and purchase power-ups to level up your character<br></li><li>The Good Ghouls combines classic beat 'em up and story-driven adventure genres through a quirky and fun story, and in a world crafted with unique art direction to invoke the nostalgia of your favorite horror movies</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/f7a63d3e1b8a619368c2d0b8a4b8ac0c.poster.avif?t=1732114955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/f7a63d3e1b8a619368c2d0b8a4b8ac0c.webm?t=1732114955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137900/extras/f7a63d3e1b8a619368c2d0b8a4b8ac0c.mp4?t=1732114955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
